---
description: Push every finished update or fix to GitHub
alwaysApply: true
---

After any update or fix is finished and verified (typecheck, lint, build, and `npm run smoke` when the server is running), commit it and push to `origin main` at https://github.com/sumit-kumawat/AI-Agent.

- Never commit `.env*` files other than `.env.example`, or anything in `data/`.
- Keep the existing color theme in `app/globals.css` unchanged unless the user asks.
